        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ralek Gracie, Rorion Gracie, Rickson Gracie, Royce Gracie, Josh Barnett\n- Organizations: Metamoris, UFC, Legends of MMA Hall of Fame, UFC Hall of Fame, Gracie family\n- Places: Los Angeles, California\n- Roles: Brazilian jiu-jitsu promotion founder, mixed martial artist, heavyweight champion, Hall of Famer, red belt\n\nFacts:\n- Rickson Gracie was born on November 21, 1958.\n- Rickson Gracie is a Brazilian 9th degree red belt in Gracie Jiu-Jitsu and a retired mixed martial artist.\n- Ralek Gracie is the son of Rorion Gracie and a member of the Gracie family.\n- Ralek Gracie is the nephew of Rickson Gracie, who is in the Legends of MMA Hall of Fame, and Royce Gracie, who is in the UFC Hall of Fame.\n- Metamoris is a Brazilian jiu-jitsu promotion founded by Ralek Gracie.\n- Metamoris organizes events in Los Angeles, California.\n- Josh Barnett is a former UFC Heavyweight Champion.\n- Josh Barnett is the inaugural and current Metamoris Heavyweight Champion.",
